;                  -> F2(C=O)  > F3(N,t2) -> F1(H,t3)
;
;on/off resonance Carbon pulses using shaped pulse
;phase sensitive (t1)
;phase sensitive using Echo/Antiecho gradient selection (t2)
;using constant time in t2
;water suppression using watergate sequence
;(use parameterset )
;
;F. Loehr, R. Haensel, V.V. Rogov & V. Doetsch, 
;   J. Biomol. NMR 37, 205-224 (2007)
;(T. Yamazaki, J.D. Forman-Kay & L.E. Kay, 
